{{#services_table:marketing}}

## Embedded content

Some pages contain content from other platforms, such as videos or maps. When such content loads, your browser connects to the provider, which receives at least your IP address and may set cookies. Where a consent rule applies, we show a placeholder first and load the content only when you allow it.

